{
  "title": "Yellow Jamaican Rhubarb Curry",
  "description": "A garlicky and comforting Jamaican dish featuring forced rhubarb, this curry is a perfect blend of flavors and textures, made with ayurvedic sattvic friendly ingredients and cooked to perfection in a wok.",
  "cuisine": "Jamaican",
  "diet": [
